  "description_short": "Overnight summer camp for girls entering grades 2–12 at two Girl Scouts of Maine camps: Camp Natarswi on Lower Togue Pond in Baxter State Park (Millinocket) and Camp Pondicherry on Adams Pond (Bridgton). Options include one-week classic and specialty programs, 2–4 week wilderness programs, Junior Maine Guide, and CIT leadership programs. Girls do not have to be Girl Scouts already.",
