  "refund_policy_summary": "Overnight camp (2026): if you cancel before June 15, 2026, you get a full refund minus the $40 non-refundable deposit. After June 15 there are no refunds, except that a refund for health reasons may be considered with a doctor's note (still minus the deposit). Family and troop programs have separate policies.",
  "swim_waterfront_notes": "Natarswi is on Lower Togue Pond, where campers swim and go boating. Pondicherry has a private waterfront on Adams Pond. Natarswi Sailors campers must be confident in deep water and pass the advanced swim test. Some water activities, such as kayaking, paddle boarding and sailing, have age or grade limits.",
